 /api/v1/rivers/nhl/news.json | 2493204
 /api/v1/rivers/nba/news.json | 2481048
 /api/v1/rivers/1/news.json | 2278832],
  [As simple as it is, the query is looking at 135 million rows and executes in
approximately 10 seconds using the base RedShift instance type. You can modify
the query a bit and see requests per day like so:],
  [SELECT COUNT ( \* ), 
 LEFT ( logdate , 12 ) as day 
 FROM cf\_logentries 
 GROUP BY day 
 ORDER BY day ;],
  [count | day
---------+------------
 4180128 | 2014-04-01
 4874722 | 2014-04-02
 4402991 | 2014-04-03
 4781033 | 2014-04-04
