  [/api/v1/rivers/ncaab/news/pinned | - | 376280 | 287165 | 76.31],
  [These hit rates are decent for most things, but you can definitely see right away
how the query parameters can be tuned a bit to provide an ever faster experience for
clients consuming these endpoints.],
  [That's pretty much it for now. There's a lot more you can do with this, as the sky is the
limit when it comes to the queries you can write against your data. Hopefully this was a
beneficial introduction to RedShift with a novel use case. If I got anything wrong let
me know!],
  [There are other obvious related things you'd want to do if you use a setup like this
(such as automating the data load) that we may cover in a future post.],
